    "two_whole": "General feasible rational LP, independent state/coin finite-level CE, same-state additive lower bound, Wstar<=L<=n, sorted balance W<=n(2b-b²), Wstar>=n(beta*)² and complete original-job OPT=2-beta* jointly pay the whole unknown-OPT13/8 target. Quadratic remainder>=1/64 on[0,1], no unit-FSLP or OPT input. The actual general-welfare guarantee separately pays both robust NO versions: h<gamma*n and delta<1 yield strict welfare upper bound, eta<1 gives positive accepted L, and1-1/e>5/8 survives equality(E) and eta=1/40,gamma=delta=3/8.",
